F1: GameState class holds state; SeededRandom(seed) drives map/colonist/event RNG; endTurn() calls production→needs→morale→storm→repairs→caravan→events in fixed order. Score 2.

F2: 8x8 map loop uses seeded rng.next() for terrain; canBuild() checks terrain===required; no adjacency-bonus code found anywhere. Score 1.

F3: mine produces ore, smelter consumes ore→metal (multi-step); storageMax enforced with overflow logged/clamped in processProduction and buyGood. Score 2.

F4: colonists have skill/level/fatigue/morale/assigned fields, but production formula (processProduction skillBonus) only reads col.level, never col.skill or col.fatigue. Score 1.

F5: processNeeds lowers morale on shortage, processMorale recovers morale +10/turn, but morale is never read in the production/output formula (only causes 30% abandonment chance below 30). Score 1.

F6: 8 research nodes, prereq check in canResearch, cost deducted in doResearch, but node.effects (greenhouse:0.2 etc.) is never read anywhere else in the file. Score 1.

F7: exactly 10 events with cooldown (eventCooldown, threshold 5) and uniform (not weighted) random pick; showEventModal only ever creates a single "OK" button — no event offers 2-3 choices. Score 1.

F8: buyGood/sellGood both work and deduct/add scrip+resource, but prices/stock are hardcoded constants in renderTrade(), not derived from state.resources or a drifting variable, and stock resets every render (not truly limited). Score 1.

F9: processStorm scales severity with turn, sets building.damage; processProduction reads healthMul=1-damage*0.3 (confirmed loss); processRepairs spends parts to reduce damage; but shield building's `mitigation` and research `stormMitigation` effect are never read in processStorm. Score 1.

F10: save() serializes full state to JSON string, clipboard-copy exposed via saveBtn; GameState.load() JSON.parses with try/catch, alert(e.message) shown on bad input. Score 2.

F11: checkWin (turn>=60 & pop>=12) and checkLose (pop===0) both reachable; getScore() combines population/research/resources/turns; showEndScreen renders modal with breakdown. Score 2.

F12: tab-btn listeners toggle active classes; log entries show `[Turn ${entry.turn}]`; map/tree tooltips explain damage/produce/cost; keydown handles Space+1-6; @media(max-width:600px) adapts layout. Score 2.

F13: runTests() has 14 real invariant checks (storage caps, prereq enforcement, save/load round-trip); runBenchmark() creates headless GameState, runs 200 endTurn() calls, prints stateHash(). Score 2.

G1: research node.effects (e.g. greenhouse:0.2) set in initResearch but no other function reads `.effects` anywhere — chain fully disconnected. Score 0.

G2: processNeeds shortage→col.morale-=20 confirmed; processMorale can set col.alive=false (30% chance) removing labor, but skillBonus formula never references col.morale directly — only the death special-case links to output. Score 2.

G3: processStorm sets building.damage; processProduction healthMul=1-damage*0.3 reads it (visible via tile tooltip "Damage: x/5"); processRepairs spends parts, reduces damage, restoring healthMul next turn. Score 4.

G4: goods array in renderTrade() has fixed buy/sell numbers (2,1/5,3/etc.), never reads game.resources or any drifting supply variable. Score 0.

G5: showEventModal only builds one "OK" button calling event.outcome(); no event presents 2-3 branching choices anywhere in the source. Score 0.

